  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a href=\"https://abvmuup.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU Uttar Pradesh</span></a>&nbsp;</span>has released the notification for UP Common Allied Healthcare Entrance Test CAHET 2026 on its official website. The online registration process for the UP CAHET Online Form 2026 started on 02 May 2026. Candidates can now apply for UP CAHET Admission 2026 to become eligible for admission to Under Graduate, Post Graduate (Master) Courses. Candidates must check the complete details of the UP CAHET Admission Form 2026 given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP CAHET Online Form 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>02 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>14 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>14 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<b>30 May 2026 to 14 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<b>Notify Soon</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available : <b>Before Exam</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000;\"><strong>For UG Courses</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000;\"><strong>For PG Courses&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 2000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through Challan Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP CAHET Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 31 December 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>17 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP CCAHET Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.854%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.146%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course Details&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.854%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Under Graduate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.146%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Medical Laboratory Science (B.MLS)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Optometry (B.OPTOM)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Anaesthesia &amp; Operation Theatre Technology (B.AOTT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Medical Radiology &amp; Imaging Technology (B.MRIT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor in Audiology and Speech Language Pathology (B.ASLP)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Physiotherapy (B.PT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Occupational Therapy (B.OT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor of Radiation Therapy Technology (B.RTT)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.854%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Graduate (Master)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.146%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Medical Laboratory Science</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Optometry</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Anaesthesia &amp; Operation Theatre Technology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Medical Radiology &amp; Imaging Technology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Physiotherapy</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master of Occupational Therapy</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">M.Sc. Audiology</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP CAHET Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Course Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Eligibility</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Under Graduate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidate with Science Subjects Physics, Chemistry, Biology (Botany &amp; Zoology) in 12th Standard examination is eligible for all Allied &amp; Healthcare Bachelor’s Courses provided</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">he/she has obtained a minimum of 50% marks in Physics, Chemistry and Biology (PCB) and passed in English individually from any recognized board.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Complete Qualification Details : <a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/English-CAHET-Bachelor-Information-Bulletin-5-6.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Graduate (Master)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation Degree in related stream with at least 50% marks from any Recognized University in India &amp; must have knowledge of Local Language.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Complete Qualification Details : <a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/English-CAHET-Masters-Information-Bulletin-4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP CAHET Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://abvmuup.edu.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the ABVMU before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other&nbsp;&nbsp;Notification Here –&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for UP CAHET Online Form can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP CAHET Application Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Selection will be based on Entrance Test.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://instagram.com/sarkariexam.com_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\